1
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:12,120
Read lesson together with teacher.

2
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:18,690
Two Brothers.

3
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:27,050
Two brothers farm one rice field together.

4
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:41,490
Harvest season comes, they harvest then divide rice into two equal piles, leaving them outside field.

5
00:00:43,690 --> 00:01:02,760
That night, younger brother thinks older brother still has wife and children, goes to field to take his rice and add to older brother's pile.

6
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:22,560
Same night, older brother thinks younger brother lives alone hardship, goes to field to take his rice and add to younger brother's pile.

7
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:29,770
Next morning, both brothers go to field together.

8
00:01:29,770 --> 00:01:38,570
They are very surprised to see two rice piles still equal.

9
00:01:40,490 --> 00:01:50,140
Until one night, both go to field to watch why there is such wonder.

10
00:01:51,030 --> 00:02:02,780
They meet each other, each carrying rice bundle intending to add for the other.

11
00:02:02,780 --> 00:02:07,530
Both are moved and hug tightly.

